sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant UI as QuoteProviderSection
    participant Hook as useQuoteInterface
    participant API as quote-interface.api
    participant HTTP as api-client (envelope)
    participant R as AdminRouter
    participant S as QuoteInterfaceService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Note over UI,DB: 场景A·1 — 列出某提供方下的接口
    UI->>Hook: useQuoteInterfaces(providerId)
    Hook->>API: listQuoteInterfaces(providerId)
    API->>HTTP: http.get(/admin/quote-providers/{pid}/interfaces)
    HTTP->>R: GET ...
    R->>S: list_by_provider(provider_id)
    S->>DB: SELECT ... WHERE provider_id=? ORDER BY category_id,name
    DB-->>S: rows
    S-->>R: list[QuoteInterface]
    R-->>HTTP: QuoteInterfaceOut[]
    HTTP-->>UI: data (envelope {code:0,data})

    Note over UI,DB: 场景A·2 — 新增接口
    UI->>Hook: useCreateQuoteInterface().mutate(body)
    Hook->>API: createQuoteInterface(providerId, body)
    API->>HTTP: http.post(/admin/quote-providers/{pid}/interfaces, body)
    HTTP->>R: POST ...
    R->>S: create(provider_id=pid, category_id=..., name=..., ...)
    S->>DB: INSERT quote_provider_interfaces
    DB-->>S: row (id, ts)
    S-->>R: QuoteInterface
    R-->>HTTP: QuoteInterfaceOut
    HTTP-->>UI: {code:0,data}
    Hook->>Hook: invalidateQueries(['admin','quote-providers',pid,'interfaces'])

    Note over UI,DB: 场景A·3 — 删除接口（级联/独立，无外键依赖）
    UI->>Hook: useDeleteQuoteInterface().mutate(interfaceId)
    Hook->>API: deleteQuoteInterface(interfaceId)
    API->>HTTP: http.delete(/admin/quote-providers/interfaces/{iid})
    HTTP->>R: DELETE ...
    R->>S: get(interface_id) then delete(iface)
    S->>DB: DELETE quote_provider_interfaces WHERE id=?
    R-->>HTTP: {id,deleted:true}
    HTTP-->>UI: {code:0,data}

---

sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant UI as InterfaceCategorySection
    participant Hook as useInterfaceCategory
    participant API as interface-category.api
    participant HTTP as api-client (envelope)
    participant R as AdminRouter
    participant S as InterfaceCategoryService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Note over UI,DB: 场景B·1 — 列出分类（证券板块下拉数据源）
    UI->>Hook: useInterfaceCategories()
    Hook->>API: listInterfaceCategories()
    API->>HTTP: http.get(/admin/interface-categories)
    HTTP->>R: GET ...
    R->>S: list()
    S->>DB: SELECT ... ORDER BY sort_order,label
    DB-->>S: rows
    S-->>R: list[InterfaceCategory]
    R-->>HTTP: InterfaceCategoryOut[]
    HTTP-->>UI: data

    Note over UI,DB: 场景B·2 — 新增分类（无唯一业务键，label 可重复）
    UI->>Hook: useCreateInterfaceCategory().mutate(body)
    Hook->>API: createInterfaceCategory(body)
    API->>HTTP: http.post(/admin/interface-categories, body)
    HTTP->>R: POST ...
    R->>S: create(label=..., icon=..., sort_order=...)
    S->>DB: INSERT quote_provider_interface_categories
    DB-->>S: row
    S-->>R: InterfaceCategory
    R-->>HTTP: InterfaceCategoryOut
    HTTP-->>UI: {code:0,data}
    Hook->>Hook: invalidateQueries(['admin','interface-categories'])
